    "Clink isn’t in your list of on-screen keyboards yet. Step 1 takes about twenty seconds.": {
      "comment": "Android-only copy for the companion app (batch B4: onboarding, setup, paywall), replacing iOS settings paths, Full Access and the App Store with their Android and Google Play counterparts. Translations drafted for the Android port; native-speaker review required before release. Add to clink-index.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "af": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clink is nog nie in jou lys skermsleutelborde nie. Stap 1 neem sowat twintig sekondes."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clink zatím není v seznamu klávesnic na obrazovce. Krok 1 zabere asi dvacet sekund."
